# user.dec — force psi(2S) → J/psi π+ π−, and let EvtGen decay J/psi however it wants
# You will remove J/psi daughters later anyway in KeepFinalOnly() for your polarized re-decay.

Decay psi(2S)
  0.6546  J/psi  pi+  pi-  VVPIPI;  # 0.3360/0.5133
  0.3454  J/psi  pi0  pi0  VVPIPI;  # 0.1773/0.5133
Enddecay

Decay J/psi
  1.0  e+  e-  VLL;
Enddecay

End

